%% fsm-contract: {"inputs":["ClinicalAssessment"],"outputs":["response text"],"confidenceTones":["alta","media","baixa"],"safetyBoundary":"descriptive-never-prescriptive","globalStateChange":false,"lifecycleChange":false,"medicalReasoning":false}
%% This contract is checked by test/fsm_mermaid_contract_test.dart.
flowchart LR
  ASSESSMENT[ClinicalAssessment] --> BUILD[ResponseBuilder.build]
  BUILD --> TONE{Confidence tier}
  TONE -->|alta| STRONG[Strong-evidence tone: assertive but not diagnostic]
  TONE -->|media| MODERATE[Moderate tone: suggestive]
  TONE -->|baixa| SOFT[Soft tone: tentative, always paired with a clarifying question]
  STRONG --> TEXT[OrchestratorReply.text]
  MODERATE --> TEXT
  SOFT --> TEXT
  SOFT --> QUESTION[Adaptive clarifying question, module clinical-clarification]

  NOTE[ResponseBuilder only renders ClinicalAssessment into text and, when confidence is not high, into a clarifying question. It never invents new clinical judgments, never proposes a dose or treatment, and creates no DiabAIGlobalState or EventStatus transition of its own.]
